    "Disk-exhaustion suppression depends on the filesystem layout and per-filesystem quotas; the probe fills small dedicated tmpfs mounts, so its ENOSPC timing is not the production filesystem's.",
    "The precreate control was measured with fs.protected_regular=0; with protected_regular=1 or 2 the recorder's O_CREAT|O_APPEND open onto an agent-owned file in a sticky world-writable directory can itself be refused, which this run did not exercise."
